{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "34", "x": 0.9034132915195562, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.030329957084079588, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "P1 answering ideas:", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.20794690396682375, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "1.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.1613150258338729, "w": 0.021371506039283665, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Quite a lot. I can't stand having a sedentary lifestyle. In fact, I make a point of", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.1613150258338729, "w": 0.7785974007053512, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "taking a brisk 30-minute walk after lunch or in the evening to hit my daily step", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.1896453759080105, "w": 0.7789363482026299, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "goal and clear my head. It's become a non-negotiable part of my routine and", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.21797572598214812, "w": 0.7789444476739805, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "my favorite way to unwind.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.24630607605628574, "w": 0.27584373423358444, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "2.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2746735439806541, "w": 0.025806094759918855, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Oh, absolutely! Back in school, I was forever dashing between classes,", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.2746735439806541, "w": 0.7784662712894348, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "sprinting to the canteen, or hustling to the library-constantly on the move.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.3030039694975767, "w": 0.7790307736850841, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "These days, though, unless I deliberately carve out time for it, I don't walk", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.33133430071101805, "w": 0.7784667839142039, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "nearly as much.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.3596646507851557, "w": 0.1639710933968496, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "3.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.38799500085929334, "w": 0.026410812568698126, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "At the moment, I live in a neighborhood right in the heart of the city.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.38799500085929334, "w": 0.7785023600731741, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Fortunately, we're surrounded by several parks with lush green spaces that", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.41632538865482344, "w": 0.779147959707283, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "are perfect for leisurely strolls. But my absolute favorite is the riverside", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.4446557764503536, "w": 0.7783579024132631, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "footpath-it offers expansive open spaces with picturesque views of passing", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.47301087175797835, "w": 0.77858335478668, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "boats, which always feels like a breath of fresh air from urban life.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.5013412218321159, "w": 0.6738313539353127, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "4.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5295232891122934, "w": 0.026209235693898627, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "To be honest, I've never tried that, but I'm absolutely keen to give it a shot.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.5295232891122934, "w": 0.7786508162062835, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Trekking through off-the-beaten-track locations like mountains, coastal", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.557853639186431, "w": 0.7789146129124233, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "paths, and forests sounds amazing. It must be challenging to cover long", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.5861840269819611, "w": 0.7784883141545028, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "distances on foot, but the rewards would be incredible.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.6145143770560988, "w": 0.5613540465522755, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "P2 answering ideas:", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6811501222399445, "w": 0.21258308237787765, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "I'd like to talk about a film I'd love to rewatch with friends, Perfect Days, directed", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7192700035412843, "w": 0.8266788230504393, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "by Wim Wenders.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.747600429058207, "w": 0.18145750602103422, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Honestly, it's not a typical action-packed blockbuster, but it's a quiet gem that has", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7858686308748994, "w": 0.8264714150688921, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "stuck with me since I first watched it. The story follows Hirayama, a public toilet", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8141990563918221, "w": 0.8264647509468949, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "cleaner in Tokyo, who leads a super-minimal life. He lives in a tiny apartment and", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8425294064659596, "w": 0.82632234378606, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "follows the same routine every day, but he's spiritually wealthy. His attention to", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8708845017735845, "w": 0.8259902654606861, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "little things-like sunlight filtering through leaves or the cassette tapes he plays in", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8992148518477221, "w": 0.8265066836530011, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "his old van-makes me rethink what happiness really means.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.9275452019218596, "w": 0.6061031003238456, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}